# Предложения

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@offerId = 000000000000000000000000
@authorId = 000000000000000000000000

## Получить список предложений

GET {{baseUrl}}/offers HTTP/1.1

###

## Получить ограниченный список предложений

GET {{baseUrl}}/offers?limit=5 HTTP/1.1

###

## Получить премиальные предложения для города

GET {{baseUrl}}/offers/premium/Paris HTTP/1.1

###

## Получить предложение по идентификатору

GET {{baseUrl}}/offers/{{offerId}} HTTP/1.1

###

## Создать новое предложение

POST {{baseUrl}}/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Beautiful apartment in the city center",
  "description": "A bright and comfortable apartment close to the main attractions.",
  "postDate": "2026-11-22T12:00:00.000Z",
  "city": {
    "name": "Paris",
    "location": {
      "latitude": 48.85661,
      "longitude": 2.351499
    }
  },
  "previewImage": "preview-apartment.jpg",
  "images": [
    "apartment-1.jpg",
    "apartment-2.jpg",
    "apartment-3.jpg",
    "apartment-4.jpg",
    "apartment-5.jpg",
    "apartment-6.jpg"
  ],
  "isPremium": true,
  "housingType": "apartment",
  "roomsCount": 3,
  "guestsCount": 4,
  "price": 2500,
  "amenities": [
    "Breakfast",
    "Air conditioning",
    "Washer"
  ],
  "authorId": "{{authorId}}",
  "location": {
    "latitude": 48.8584,
    "longitude": 2.2945
  }
}

###

## Обновить предложение

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/offers/{{offerId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated apartment in the city center",
  "price": 2700,
  "isPremium": false
}

###

## Удалить предложение

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/offers/{{offerId}} HTTP/1.1

###
